  "text": "Blogs\n\nWelcome to our blogs!\n\nDive into the world of Artificial Intelligence, where we explore cutting-edge research,\n\ninnovative applications, and the latest trends shaping the future of technology.\n\nZero to Mamba\n\nWritten by\n\nHarshith MR\n\nAlphaZero: A Revolutionary Approach to Game-Playing AI\n\n​Written by:\n\nSreeram R\n\nMinecraft : Pushing the Boundaries of GenAI\n\nWritten by\n\nAniruddh K\n\nGenie 2: A large-scale foundation world model\n\n​Written by:\n\nArjun K\n\nPaper Review :\nSAIL\n\nWritten by\n\nAnish V\n\nExploring KANs\n\n​Written by:\n\nDevisree A\n\nPaper Review :\nSoccerNet\n\nWritten by\n\nDaniel\n\nPaper Review\nGameNGen\n\n​Written by:\n\nAnshuman Mishra\n\nGPT - 4 (o)rigins\n\nDevelopments of GPT models over the years and emphasis on it's latest release, GPT 4o\n\nWritten by:\n\nNishitha D\n\nPaper Review\nMicrosoft Graph RAG\n\n​Written by:\n\nHarshith MR\n\nPaper Review\nConformers\n\nWritten by:\n\nSreeram R\n\nLLMs Unveiled\n\nUnlocking new worlds, one word at a time. LLMs are reshaping intelligence, creating and innovating beyond imagination\n\n​\n\nWritten by:\n\nJaanav Mathavan\n\nSakthi Prathosh\n\nAnupam Loy Geeto\n\nNLP for Indian\nLanguages\n\nUtilizing NLP and LLM to uncover the hidden details of our languages, bridging the linguistic gap for a more inclusive digital world\n\n​\n\nWritten by:\n\nAtreya Vedantam\n\nAditya Tamras\n\nPranay Mathur\n\nGemini\nThe new kid on block\n\nA look into the newly released GPT model released by Google, its workings and privacy concerns of LLMs\n\n​\n\nWritten by:\n\nShailesh Kasivelrajan\n\nJyothiraditya\n\nPaper Review\nMixtral 8x7B\n\nWritten by:\n\nSumedh Chatterjee\n\nRyan Jacob George\n\nB Shabarish\n\nChatGPT\nHow does it work?\n\nIs my future job at danger due to this ?!\n\n​\n\nWritten by\n\nShakti Sharma\n\nPaper Review\nPaint With RL\n\nWritten by:\n\nVinayak\n\nPaper Review\nMuZero : 'Unbeatable' RL\n\n​Written by:\n\nNiveath\n\nPriyanka\n\nGokul\n\nRuthwik",
